  <!-- ============= Screen: FBA intro ======================================= -->

  <Vertical id="bmod_h1_fba_intro" title="4. Functional behavioral analysis">
    <Markdown id="bmod_h1_fba_text">
## 4. Perform a functional behavioral analysis (FBA)

Next you will detail the **ABCs** of your unwanted target behavior.

* **A — Antecedents**: what happens *before* the behavior and leads to it.
* **B — Behavior**: what you are actively doing *during* the behavior.
* **C — Consequences**: what happens *after* the behavior, as a result of it.

These three must be different from one another. Antecedents lead to behaviors,
which lead to consequences.
    </Markdown>
  </Vertical>

